# Local consent registry — stores owner face embeddings (biometric data).
# Keep it LOCAL only; never commit. Use consent_registry.example.json as a template.
data/consent_registry.json

# Real face photos used for the Phase 1 e2e threshold test — keep these LOCAL
# only (do not publish biometric data of you / teammates into the repo).
# The test README under this folder documents the expected filenames.
test/samples/*.jpg
test/samples/*.jpeg
test/samples/*.png
test/samples/*.webp
test/samples/*.heic
!test/samples/README.md
